NDS WILL CONDUCT PT IN ACCORDANCE WITH OPNAVINST6110.1L (DATED 29DEC2025).\nSAFETY OFFICER OPERATIONS OFFICER EXECUTIVE OFFICER COMMANDING OFFICER\nLCDR ISBELL LCDR MERRITT COL PIANTANIDA CDR VIGER"
